define('taoQtiItem/qtiCreator/renderers/Math',['lodash', 'taoQtiItem/qtiCommonRenderer/renderers/Math', 'taoQtiItem/qtiCreator/widgets/static/math/Widget', 'taoQtiItem/qtiItem/core/Element'], function (_, Renderer, Widget, Element) {
  'use strict';

  var CreatorMath = _.clone(Renderer);
  function isEditable(element) {
    var parent = element.parent();
    return !Element.isA(parent, 'hottext');
  }
  CreatorMath.render = function (math, options) {
    if (isEditable(math)) {
      Renderer.render(math);
      Widget.build(math, Renderer.getContainer(math), this.getOption('bodyElementOptionForm'), options);
    }
  };
  return CreatorMath;
});
